// =====================================================================
// PMO Project Dashboard – DAX measures
// Extracted from report/PMO_Project_Dashboard.pbix
// =====================================================================


// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
// Active Projects                                    Home table: Projects
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
// Point-in-time count of projects that are "live" on the last date in
// the current filter context of the (disconnected) DateTable.
//
// How it works
//   1. CurrentDate = the latest date visible in the visual's context
//      (for a month on the axis, that is the month-end date).
//   2. ALL(Projects) evaluates every project, independent of filters
//      on the Projects table.
//   3. A project counts when StartDate <= CurrentDate <= EndDate.
//
// Why a disconnected DateTable?
//   Projects have two dates (start and end). A normal relationship to a
//   single date column could only answer "projects that started in
//   month X". Comparing the calendar date against both columns inside
//   the measure answers "projects in flight during month X".
//
// Used in: line chart "Active Projects by Month"
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
Active Projects =
VAR CurrentDate = MAX ( DateTable[Date] )
RETURN
    COUNTROWS (
        FILTER (
            ALL ( Projects ),
            Projects[StartDate] <= CurrentDate
                && Projects[EndDate] >= CurrentDate
        )
    )


// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
// Implicit measures used by visuals
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
// The visuals below use Power BI's built-in aggregations rather than
// explicit measures:
//
//   Card – Allocated budget         Sum of Budgets[AllocatedBudget]
//   Card – Spent to date            Sum of Budgets[SpentToDate]
//   Bar  – Budget vs spend          Sum of AllocatedBudget, Sum of SpentToDate
//   Column – Risks per project      Count of Risks[RiskID]
//   100% column – Milestone status  Count of Projects[StartDate]
//
// Explicit versions of these are in proposed-measures.dax.
